@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Current user (validated locally against Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
yvli-token: {{token}}

### Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
yvli-token: {{token}}

{"sessionId":"demo-1","message":"你好"}
